    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110559" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φερέ-οικος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carrying one's house with
				one,</i> of the Scythians in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>house-carrier,</i> i.e. <i>snail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				571
			</span></i>: acc. to others, a kind <i>of wasp,</i> or <i>a tortoise,</i>
			<i><span class="en">Hsch.,
				<u>EM</u>790.35</span></i>, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέροικος.</span></div>
